@title Cabinet: field, door and plate (Mounted row, Size enclosure note, Issues, Place all)
@area Cabinet
# qa/fixtures/cabinet-sites.novo (built by write_sites_fixture): cabinet +CP1 with a door, a contactor -K1, a 4 kW drive -T1, a push button -S1 and a lamp -H1 not placed yet, and a motor -M1 that was put on the plate by hand. The motor is a field device: it is not placed by Place all, is not counted by Size enclosure and raises a warning while it sits on the plate. -S1 and -H1 go to the door.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-sites.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-before
# The Mounted row of the Inspector, with the choice open.
click 969 192
wait 10
shot inspector-mounted
expect "Mounted"
expect "In the field"
click_text "In the field"
wait 6
shot inspector-mounted-choice
key Escape
wait 4
# Size enclosure says what it did not count.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text size enclosure
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Not counted"
shot size-enclosure-not-counted
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
# The warning in the Issues list.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text issues
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "mounted outside the cabinet"
shot issues-field-device
key Escape
wait 4
# Place all leaves the motor out and sends the button and the lamp to the door.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot place-all-preview
check_layout
key Enter
wait 20
shot placed
expect_not "M1 is not placed"
# The button and the lamp are on the door surface.
click 177 70
wait 6
shot surface-choice
